== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: uwrmsr [ENC: VEX, MAP: MAP7, OPC: 0xF8]
     LENGTH:  9
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: USER_MSR
    ISA-SET: USER_MSR
    ISA-EXT: USER_MSR
 EXCEPTIONS: USER_MSR_VEX
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_VEX 
  OPTIMIZED: C4 C7 7A F8 C7 78 56 34 12 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0  IMMEDIATE    EXPLICIT       R        UIMM32     32      1      32       INT  [U A 32] 0x0000000012345678
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     64      1      64      UINT                          r15
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 128
  BROADCAST: NONE

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: uwrmsr %r15, $0x12345678
   RELATIVE: uwrmsr %r15, $0x12345678

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: uwrmsr 0x12345678, r15
   RELATIVE: uwrmsr 0x12345678, r15

